## Key Findings Summary

### Top Price Drivers (Positive)
1. **Vehicle Age/Year** - Newer vehicles (0-3 years) command 30-50% premium
2. **Low Mileage** - Under 75K miles adds 25-35% value
3. **Luxury Brands** - Mercedes, BMW, Tesla add 20-40% premium
4. **Vehicle Type** - Trucks/SUVs command 15-25% premium
5. **4WD/AWD** - Adds 10-15% value
6. **Excellent Condition** - 20-30% premium
7. **Diesel/Electric** - 10-20% premium

### Factors That Decrease Price
1. **High Mileage** (>100K miles) - 20-30% reduction
2. **Old Age** (>15 years) - 40-60% reduction
3. **Salvage Title** - 50-70% reduction
4. **Poor Condition** - Significant markdown

